00:10:00.949 --> 00:10:01.149
&gt;&gt;

00:10:01.149 --> 00:10:02.149
[Laughing]

00:10:01.149 --> 00:10:05.870
BILL B.: I got my first bite of a mandate and it was a

00:10:05.889 --> 00:10:06.889
