00:10:13.339 --> 00:10:14.939
Fleet, had

00:10:14.959 --> 00:10:17.459
some kind of fishing dispute with somebody buying their fish

00:10:16.519 --> 00:10:17.519
and they

00:10:17.519 --> 00:10:19.519
had hired Cleary GottliebCleary Gottlieb to settle this

00:10:19.019 --> 00:10:20.019
dispute and

00:10:20.019 --> 00:10:22.519
Cleary Gottlieb, the big New York law firm, had recommened

00:10:22.019 --> 00:10:23.019
that they

00:10:23.019 --> 00:10:25.980
