won the

00:10:39.699 --> 00:10:40.699
assignment.

00:10:39.959 --> 00:10:43.490
Please come and negotiate fees.

00:10:43.509 --> 00:10:47.919
And so I started getting in touch with them to negotiate

00:10:47.939 --> 00:10:50.230
