00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:50.120
And he had hired me to decide whether the management should

00:11:50.139 --> 00:11:51.139
exercise

00:11:51.139 --> 00:11:54.240
their right under the privatization program to purchase 51

00:11:54.259 --> 00:11:55.259
percent of

00:11:55.259 --> 00:11:57.509
this fleet for two and a half million dollars.

00:11:56.889 --> 00:11:57.089
&gt;&gt;

00:11:57.089 --> 00:11:58.089
[Laughing]

00:11:57.089 --> 00:12:03.349
BILL B.: So it was actually quite an easy assignment.

00:12:03.369 --> 00:12:03.569
&gt;&gt;

00:12:03.569 --> 00:12:04.569
[Laughing]

00:12:03.569 --> 00:12:07.299
BILL B.: And, again, you didn't have to be a Stanford MBA to

00:12:07.319 --> 00:12:08.319
advise

00:12:08.319 --> 00:12:09.319
on this stuff.

00:12:09.069 --> 00:12:11.929
5 million market cap, a billion dollars worth of ships, uh .

00:12:11.949 --> 00:12:12.149
..

00:12:12.149 --> 00:12:12.350
&gt;&gt;

00:12:12.149 --> 00:12:13.149
[Laughing]

00:12:12.149 --> 00:12:19.360
BILL B.: I had that chemical reaction that I had from Poland

00:12:19.379 --> 00:12:20.379
sort of

00:12:20.379 --> 00:12:23.129
pumping through my system at this point and I thought to

00:12:22.629 --> 00:12:23.629
myself, I

00:12:23.629 --> 00:12:26.389
wanna get involved in some of this stuff.

00:12:26.409 --> 00:12:29.409
And so the first thing I did after leaving there was I

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:29.610
instead of

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:32.610
going back to London I went to Moscow to see whether this

00:12:32.399 --> 00:12:33.399
was just an

00:12:33.399 --> 00:12:36.149
ano, ma'am lee in fishing fleet or whether the whole

00:12:35.649 --> 00:12:36.649
situation was the

00:12:36.649 --> 00:12:37.649
same all other Russia.

00:12:37.649 --> 00:12:40.399
And it turned out that the entire Russia was being put

00:12:40.179 --> 00:12:41.179
through the

00:12:41.179 --> 00:12:43.549
same type of privatization program.

00:12:43.569 --> 00:12:46.819
And what I learned -- I didn't know a soul in Moscow, I

00:12:46.349 --> 00:12:47.349
didn't speak a

00:12:47.349 --> 00:12:50.099
word of Russian, and I got ahold of an English language

00:12:49.709 --> 00:12:50.709
Yellow Page

00:12:50.709 --> 00:12:52.709
