could ever

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:33.699
work on his team for long 'cause he just had no -- not a

00:15:33.719 --> 00:15:34.719
character to

00:15:34.719 --> 00:15:35.870
work with.

00:15:35.889 --> 00:15:39.389
And so I go and sit down with him and I start taking him

00:15:38.279 --> 00:15:39.279
through my

00:15:39.279 --> 00:15:41.529
PowerPoint presentation showing him these numbers that I've

00:15:40.529 --> 00:15:41.529
just

00:15:41.529 --> 00:15:42.529
