00:16:41.039 --> 00:16:43.039
We're gone in invest in this stuff.

00:16:42.539 --> 00:16:43.539
This is amazing.

00:16:43.539 --> 00:16:46.789
All of a sudden a big cloud and the big weight has been

00:16:46.539 --> 00:16:47.539
lifted off my

00:16:47.539 --> 00:16:48.539
