00:16:47.789 --> 00:16:51.039
I go back to London and I start investing -- I go to London,

00:16:50.719 --> 00:16:51.719
get my

00:16:51.719 --> 00:16:54.469
stuff organized, I then go to Moscow, and we start investing

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:54.870
this

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:57.620
$25 million which was an enormous amount of money for the

00:16:56.069 --> 00:16:57.069
Russian

00:16:57.069 --> 00:16:58.069
market back then.

00:16:57.979 --> 00:17:01.959
And we get the $25 million invested and seven months later,

00:17:01.979 --> 00:17:02.979
now we're

00:17:02.979 --> 00:17:06.670
in the middle of 1984, the Economist Magazine writes an

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:07.690
