00:17:18.359 --> 00:17:19.399
thing."

00:17:19.419 --> 00:17:22.419
And so they started calling up brokers or whoever and try to

00:17:20.919 --> 00:17:21.919
get

00:17:21.919 --> 00:17:23.129
invested.

00:17:23.149 --> 00:17:25.649
And our 25 million-dollar portfolio, in that seven month

00:17:25.139 --> 00:17:26.139
period,

00:17:26.139 --> 00:17:28.889
because of this economist's article went up five times in

00:17:28.599 --> 00:17:29.599
