00:17:29.599 --> 00:17:32.349
because all of a sudden 30 people started showing up and

00:17:32.159 --> 00:17:33.159
buying this

00:17:33.159 --> 00:17:34.159
stuff.

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:38.119
So I've gone from 25 to 125 million this was back in the

00:17:38.139 --> 00:17:39.139
days where a

00:17:39.139 --> 00:17:40.889
hundred million was a lot of money.

00:17:40.689 --> 00:17:40.889
&gt;&gt;

00:17:40.889 --> 00:17:41.889
[Laughing]

00:17:40.889 --> 00:17:48.579
BILL B.: And so all of a sudden all the guys who weren't

00:17:48.599 --> 00:17:49.599
inviting me

00:17:49.599 --> 00:17:52.349
to lunch and weren't hanging out with me anymore started

00:17:51.599 --> 00:17:52.599
coming around

00:17:52.599 --> 00:17:55.349
my desk saying, Bill, how can we get involved in this

