Russian stuff?

00:17:55.859 --> 00:17:59.109
And I'd like to buy some of this stuff for my personal

00:17:57.569 --> 00:17:58.569
account.

00:17:58.569 --> 00:18:00.819
And literally, every morning, there was, like, four guys

